 "result_text": "`quiz.get_all_quiz_submissions()` now returns a `PaginatedList` instead of a plain list built from a single response. It reads the `quiz_submissions` key from each page and fetches further pages as you iterate, so it no longer stops at 10. The change is in `canvasapi/quiz.py`, and I also updated the docstring's return type.\n\nI haven't run the tests or tried it against a real quiz. I also didn't change the default page size to 100 as the issue suggested. Callers can pass `per_page=100` themselves to cut the number of requests.\n\nBecause it's now a `PaginatedList`, callers can iterate it and index it, but `len()` won't work on it, unlike the old list. The existing test for this method may need updating, and I left the tests alone as you asked.",
